                <pb facs="0137" n="55" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg55"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Address of the Prussian Chamber of Deputies.</head>
                <p>The Polish members of the Chamber of Deputies of Prussia, at this moment present
                    in Berlin, join their German colleagues in expressing all the grief and
                    indignation they have experienced on learning of the abominable crime to which
                    the illustrious President Lincoln has fallen a victim—a martyr to the great
                    cause of the abolition of slavery.</p>
                <p>(Follow the signatures.)</p>
            </div>
